.br
\fIoptions\fR ({ once?: false }; optional)
.TP
\fBspawn(command, args, options)\fR
Spawns a child process executing `command` directly with `args`.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIcommand\fR (string; required)
.br
\fIargs\fR (string[] \\| ChildProcessOptions; optional)
.br
\fIoptions\fR (ChildProcessOptions; optional; default null)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIChildProcess\fR
.TP
\fBexec(command, options, callback)\fR
Executes a command string through the platform shell.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIcommand\fR (string; required)
.br
\fIoptions\fR (ExecOptions \\| ExecCallback; optional; default null)
.br
\fIcallback\fR (ExecCallback; optional; default null)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIChildProcess & PromiseLike<{ stdout: string \\| Buffer, stderr: string \\| Buffer }>\fR
.TP
\fBexecFile(file, args, options, callback)\fR
Executes a file directly with tokenized arguments.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIfile\fR (string; required)
.br
\fIargs\fR (string[] \\| ExecFileOptions \\| ExecCallback; optional)
.br
\fIoptions\fR (ExecFileOptions \\| ExecCallback; optional; default null)
.br
