.br
\fIChildProcess & PromiseLike<{ stdout: string \\| Buffer, stderr: string \\| Buffer }>\fR
.TP
\fBexecSync(command, options)\fR
Executes a command string synchronously through the platform shell.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
